@startuml
title Plan / Build / Review 流程
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #2D3142
  FontColor #2D3142
}
start
:Plan：理解代码、找调用链、提出方案;
:人工确认：范围、风险、迁移与回滚;
:Build：修改实现、补测试、运行验证;
:Review：检查 diff、边界和回归;
stop
@enduml
